        <mxCell id="skillsbox" value="&lt;b&gt;Навыки (90)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;72 domain: языки · фреймворки · БД · DevOps · security · testing&lt;br&gt;18 packs: Parallel (15) · deep-research · context7-mcp · find-skills&lt;br&gt;Память: memory MCP · continuous-learning-v2 (instincts)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Приоритет: built-in → ~/.claude → ~/.agents → ~/.config/opencode → .opencode → config&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#E9D58A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
